</Output>
</Group></Presentation-Block><Presentation-Block>
<Group view="presentation" hide-input="false" hide-output="true" inline-output="false" labelreference="L586" drawlabel="true">
<Input>
<Text-field style="Text" layout="Normal" spaceabove="10">Remember that, in Maple, you can use the selection operation on a string in the same way as for a list.  So the third character is obtained as follows.</Text-field>
</Input>
</Group>
