<Text-field style="Text" layout="Normal" spaceabove="10">(3) Bob also chooses a secret integer <Equation executable="false" style="2D Math" input-equation="" display="LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYkLUklbXN1YkdGJDYlLUkjbWlHRiQ2JVEia0YnLyUnaXRhbGljR1EldHJ1ZUYnLyUsbWF0aHZhcmlhbnRHUSdpdGFsaWNGJy1GIzYlLUkjbW5HRiQ2JFEiMkYnL0Y2USdub3JtYWxGJ0YyRjUvJS9zdWJzY3JpcHRzaGlmdEdRIjBGJ0Y+">LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYkLUklbXN1YkdGJDYlLUkjbWlHRiQ2JVEia0YnLyUnaXRhbGljR1EldHJ1ZUYnLyUsbWF0aHZhcmlhbnRHUSdpdGFsaWNGJy1GIzYlLUkjbW5HRiQ2JFEiMkYnL0Y2USdub3JtYWxGJ0YyRjUvJS9zdWJzY3JpcHRzaGlmdEdRIjBGJ0Y+</Equation> and sends the value to Alice.  From the perspective of Alice, we won't know what value of <Equation executable="false" style="2D Math" input-equation="" display="LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYkLUklbXN1YkdGJDYlLUkjbWlHRiQ2JVEia0YnLyUnaXRhbGljR1EldHJ1ZUYnLyUsbWF0aHZhcmlhbnRHUSdpdGFsaWNGJy1GIzYlLUkjbW5HRiQ2JFEiMkYnL0Y2USdub3JtYWxGJ0YyRjUvJS9zdWJzY3JpcHRzaGlmdEdRIjBGJ0Y+">LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYkLUklbXN1YkdGJDYlLUkjbWlHRiQ2JVEia0YnLyUnaXRhbGljR1EldHJ1ZUYnLyUsbWF0aHZhcmlhbnRHUSdpdGFsaWNGJy1GIzYlLUkjbW5HRiQ2JFEiMkYnL0Y2USdub3JtYWxGJ0YyRjUvJS9zdWJzY3JpcHRzaGlmdEdRIjBGJ0Y+</Equation> that Bob chooses, only the value of <Equation executable="false" style="2D Math" input-equation="" display=""></Equation>.  So we'll have Maple choose <Equation executable="false" style="2D Math" input-equation="" display="LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYkLUklbXN1YkdGJDYlLUkjbWlHRiQ2JVEia0YnLyUnaXRhbGljR1EldHJ1ZUYnLyUsbWF0aHZhcmlhbnRHUSdpdGFsaWNGJy1GIzYlLUkjbW5HRiQ2JFEiMkYnL0Y2USdub3JtYWxGJ0YyRjUvJS9zdWJzY3JpcHRzaGlmdEdRIjBGJ0Y+">LUklbXJvd0c2Iy9JK21vZHVsZW5hbWVHNiJJLFR5cGVzZXR0aW5nR0koX3N5c2xpYkdGJzYkLUklbXN1YkdGJDYlLUkjbWlHRiQ2JVEia0YnLyUnaXRhbGljR1EldHJ1ZUYnLyUsbWF0aHZhcmlhbnRHUSdpdGFsaWNGJy1GIzYlLUkjbW5HRiQ2JFEiMkYnL0Y2USdub3JtYWxGJ0YyRjUvJS9zdWJzY3JpcHRzaGlmdEdRIjBGJ0Y+</Equation> randomly in the computation.</Text-field>
